WEBVTT


00:00:00.060 --> 00:00:02.580
This is the fastest growing data and analytics

00:00:02.581 --> 00:00:04.361
product in Microsoft's history.

00:00:04.420 --> 00:00:08.020
It's called Microsoft Fabric Unified Data Platform for the AI era.

00:00:08.021 --> 00:00:12.021
So a raw data will come from bunch of sources like database API,

00:00:12.022 --> 00:00:13.401
Excel, Sharepoint list,

00:00:13.540 --> 00:00:16.980
and this all will be uploaded into Fabric Lakehouse,

00:00:16.981 --> 00:00:19.201
which is your central data storage.

00:00:19.440 --> 00:00:21.880
Now that data is raw and messy.

00:00:21.900 --> 00:00:23.660
It has wrong formats, duplicates,

00:00:23.661 --> 00:00:27.521
missing values. This is where dataflow gentle kicks in.

00:00:27.620 --> 00:00:31.260
Dataflow is your power query running inside fabric.

00:00:31.261 --> 00:00:35.001
But the main difference is Power Query cleans data for one report.

00:00:35.060 --> 00:00:38.340
Dataflow cleans it and writes it back into the Lakehouse

00:00:38.341 --> 00:00:40.261
and any report can use it.

00:00:40.262 --> 00:00:41.581
Once the data is clean,

00:00:41.582 --> 00:00:44.381
you can build semantic models with data measures,

00:00:44.382 --> 00:00:47.641
relationships and logics all inside fabric itself.

00:00:47.740 --> 00:00:51.620
And then Power BI will read it directly through Direct Lake,

00:00:51.621 --> 00:00:54.321
which is live and connected to your lakehouse.

00:00:54.500 --> 00:00:58.540
Also the semantic model can be used in your fabric data agents,

00:00:58.541 --> 00:01:00.061
which are these AI agents

00:01:00.062 --> 00:01:05.101
be directly into fabric that help users answer questions like

00:01:05.102 --> 00:01:06.741
why did sales drop in October

00:01:06.742 --> 00:01:08.321
using plain English?

00:01:08.420 --> 00:01:11.720
The data agents grow through the data and give back the answers.

00:01:11.940 --> 00:01:15.500
Every analyst in the Microsoft stack needs to learn this platform

00:01:15.501 --> 00:01:17.781
because all the AI agent, the predictive work,

00:01:17.782 --> 00:01:19.881
the automations for your organization,

00:01:19.940 --> 00:01:23.292
all the next level future work is being built here.
